    "explanation": "Rehgar is particularly good on Maps where macro is important (such as Sky Temple) as he can capture most Mercenary Camps on his own.\n\nDue to his limited amount of sustain healing, especially when the damage is concentrated on a single target, Rehgar does suffer on Maps where there is constant action (notably Braxis Holdout)."
